recommend check-in (Keaton) -- four of %568's five red cadence guards remain and each is a reading a lap can take, yet where the 5,106-second cadence cost lands across eight ships is a fleet-wide spend and stays yours. My own lane's next door is the several-line interleave, which wants an anchor per insert and widens Diff -- a seam rather than a lap.
